<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 02-OCT.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 02-OCT.</headline>
<text>
<p>A tropical storm warning is up for southwestern Mexico from Acapulco to Manzanillo. A hurricane watch is up from Zihuatanejo to Manzanillo. Tropical Storm Hernan, with 65 mph winds, is centered 260 miles southeast of Manzanillo, Mexico. Top winds are 65 mph and further strengthen is expected. Hernan may turn northward enough to hit Mexico in the warned area.  </p>
<p>Tropical Storm Zane will move into the waters well southeast of Japan this period and will not be a threat to land.  </p>
<p>There are no further satements at this times...</p>
</text>
